   180	### 0.2 Pinned premise sets
   181	
   182	Entries cite these sets as hypotheses. Each set is an exact copy.
   183	
   184	**`env.r147`** — r147 §1, lines 36–101. File `fgsa-conditional.md`, sha256
   185	`940e481501f8c52f57bd7110faa442b54ce4aa3bb512769a07c9b769037ea0f5`.
