  4368	> ```latex
  4369	> \paragraph{Trees.}  $\Sigma.\T$ is DC's admitted tree, with the same
  4370	> name and the same rules as in~\DC{7}.  It is parent-closed and
  4371	> cumulative: a new block enters it only if it extends~$F$, and no block
  4372	> leaves it~\cite{DC}.  A node never computes the state of, or unpacks, a
  4373	> block that does not extend its~$F$.  The \emph{active view} is
  4374	> \[
  4375	>  \act(\Sigma)=\{B\in\Sigma.\T: B\preceq\Sigma.F\ \text{or}\ \Sigma.F\preceq B\}.
  4376	> \]
  4377	> The SA base reads only the active view: the gate, release, resolution,
  4378	> saved-result tests, leases, and the confirmation walk~\cite[\S2]{FB}.
