  4674	
  4675	- Variant `fj`. Source r148 §3 F2, lines 234–258. File `fj-redteam.md`,
  4676	  sha256 `934fe2927f047a11e37dbe52aba9d754d5c461927f24b91902077f17459d47d2`.
