  6687	## 6. Invariants used by the composition (V03)
  6688	
  6689	Three separate invariants, each over execution prefixes:
  6690	- clean history (GST = 0 regimes);
  6691	- post-reset source history: from the reset boundary, each source body from
  6692	  its first transfer HEAD q_s (not all pre-reset sources: old justification
  6693	  disclosure is a counterexample, fgsa-fast.md);
  6694	- armed-prefix Outage history: B only, not every later body (two partition
  6695	  branches can both extend B).
  6696	
  6697	`Harmless` is stated as compatibility with the body being protected, not as
  6698	provenance of one row of a new quorum.
  6699	
