  4910	>
  4911	> F12 — PROVED for effective changes after relay settling. Fix an honest
  4912	> archival frontier m during a no-rise interval. After one P margin,
  4913	> a maximizing witness is in every duty view. Under a≤f there is at
  4914	> most one justified entry at m−1. There are at most these phases:
  4915	>
  4916	> ```text
  4917	> gap: no top J
  4918	>     -> uncontested top J
  4919	>     -> contested top J
  4920	>
  4921	> or gap -> contested top J.
