  4924	> The first top-J evidence and the first contest evidence can each
  4925	> interrupt an attempt once. Within P of each event, accepted-object
  4926	> relay and a later freeze put the relevant evidence in every view.
  4927	> Repeated copies do not start a new phase. Later frontier blocks only
  4928	> add witnesses once the phase is settled.
