  4931	> an independent exclusion. A finalization at m−1 is the same unique
  4932	> top J. It is impossible in the contested phase by F2; in the
  4933	> uncontested phase the root already enforces it. A finalization at m
  4934	> requires a carrier above m, which ends the no-rise interval.
